WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
We believe this comes from the top.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:08.120
It looks like J.B. Pritzker is putting politics ahead of public safety, ahead of our law enforcement,

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.120
their safety.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:14.240
The facts on the ground are the fact that our law enforcement were being rammed by vehicles,

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:19.200
about 10 vehicles, one of which had a semi-automatic firearm on her.

